    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cThe asylum was abandoned. The horrors were not.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Providence</strong> is a psychological horror exploration game set in the ruins of a long-forgotten asylum. You play as Finley \u201cFinn\u201d Clarke, an urban explorer drawn into a place where reality bends, memories twist, and something unnatural lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a shifting world where every shadow tells a story. Solve layered puzzles, interact with objects in immersive ways, and uncover secrets buried deep within the asylum\u2019s walls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate your environment in tactile, physical ways. Doors, drawers, and devices aren\u2019t just props\u2014they\u2019re part of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/0d4c4864100a10dc33f9e62a6412ff4d.poster.webp?t=1750800689\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/0d4c4864100a10dc33f9e62a6412ff4d.webp?t=1750800689\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reactive Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The asylum changes as you play. Rooms shift, paths appear or disappear, and familiar places warp based on your actions. The world responds to you\u2014sometimes subtly, sometimes not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/a0b6d0adb9253caba3a6dcb9161811d6.poster.webp?t=1750800689\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/a0b6d0adb9253caba3a6dcb9161811d6.webp?t=1750800689\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item Discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search, collect, and use key items to unlock deeper paths\u2014and deeper truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/a09928452b47858412f8c204b4e6311e.poster.webp?t=1750800689\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/a09928452b47858412f8c204b4e6311e.webp?t=1750800689\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environmental Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through atmospheric, logic-driven challenges that reveal fragments of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/c9ec2ca19d5d18ba844b6cf7a419bb09.poster.webp?t=1750800689\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/c9ec2ca19d5d18ba844b6cf7a419bb09.webp?t=1750800689\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of richly detailed spaces, from decaying hospital wards to overgrown courtyards and sealed-off research wings. Every area is hand-crafted to tell a story through atmosphere, sound, and environmental detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/8017977c7b358ab2efe1ddece63abb94.poster.webp?t=1750800689\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/8017977c7b358ab2efe1ddece63abb94.webp?t=1750800689\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only contact is Claire, a voice on the walkie-talkie. Sometimes she answers. Sometimes\u2026 something else does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The asylum is watching. Will you uncover its truth\u2014or be consumed by it?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cThe asylum was abandoned. The horrors were not.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Providence</strong> is a psychological horror exploration game set in the ruins of a long-forgotten asylum. You play as Finley \u201cFinn\u201d Clarke, an urban explorer drawn into a place where reality bends, memories twist, and something unnatural lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a shifting world where every shadow tells a story. Solve layered puzzles, interact with objects in immersive ways, and uncover secrets buried deep within the asylum\u2019s walls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate your environment in tactile, physical ways. Doors, drawers, and devices aren\u2019t just props\u2014they\u2019re part of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/0d4c4864100a10dc33f9e62a6412ff4d.poster.webp?t=1750800689\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/0d4c4864100a10dc33f9e62a6412ff4d.webp?t=1750800689\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reactive Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The asylum changes as you play. Rooms shift, paths appear or disappear, and familiar places warp based on your actions. The world responds to you\u2014sometimes subtly, sometimes not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/a0b6d0adb9253caba3a6dcb9161811d6.poster.webp?t=1750800689\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/a0b6d0adb9253caba3a6dcb9161811d6.webp?t=1750800689\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item Discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search, collect, and use key items to unlock deeper paths\u2014and deeper truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/a09928452b47858412f8c204b4e6311e.poster.webp?t=1750800689\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/a09928452b47858412f8c204b4e6311e.webp?t=1750800689\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environmental Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through atmospheric, logic-driven challenges that reveal fragments of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/c9ec2ca19d5d18ba844b6cf7a419bb09.poster.webp?t=1750800689\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/c9ec2ca19d5d18ba844b6cf7a419bb09.webp?t=1750800689\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of richly detailed spaces, from decaying hospital wards to overgrown courtyards and sealed-off research wings. Every area is hand-crafted to tell a story through atmosphere, sound, and environmental detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/8017977c7b358ab2efe1ddece63abb94.poster.webp?t=1750800689\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/8017977c7b358ab2efe1ddece63abb94.webp?t=1750800689\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=338 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only contact is Claire, a voice on the walkie-talkie. Sometimes she answers. Sometimes\u2026 something else does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The asylum is watching. Will you uncover its truth\u2014or be consumed by it?</p>",
